sensing and ground-based surveys.\",\n    \"related_publications\": [],\n    \"download_url\": \"https://agridata.com/soil_data.json\",\n    \"metadata\": {\n        \"data_size\": \"150MB\",\n        \"annotations\": \"Data accuracy estimated at 90%.\"\n    }\n}"}
